    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but making amends is just more harm, honestly. every time i try to fix it, i just mess up more or remind people of what happened. it feels like the only way to actually stop the damage from spreading is to just... stop being a factor. it feels like the world would be a cleaner, better place if i just wasn't in it anymore. am i being crazy for thinking that?",
